  <p>
    I also produced more than 100 campaigns for local businesses and nonprofits
    across the Tri-Cities. For each client I wrote the script, directed the
    shoot, and handled the edit and motion graphics, for broadcast and digital.
    Sponsored content kept a 90% retention rate.
